------------------

Input data: 391 taxa with 3 partitions and 16813 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	391	4252	1913	1027	2532	2532	LTRregion_DNA+rest_DNA+all_CP3
   2	DNA	391	10048	2273	1826	6920	6920	gag_DNA+pol-pro_DNA+env_DNA+px_DNA+all_CP2
   3	DNA	391	2513	640	257	2008	2008	all_CP1

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

