Best-fit model according to BIC: TIM2+F+I+R3:LTRregion_DNA+rest_DNA+all_CP3,TN+F+I+R3:gag_DNA+pol-pro_DNA+env_DNA+px_DNA+all_CP2,TIM2+F+I+R4:all_CP1

