   3  TIM2+F+I+R4    0.9585  TIM2{0.777924,13.6461,4.68254}+F{0.233339,0.338702,0.203402,0.224557}+I{0.59657}+R4{0.324145,0.556503,0.0668044,5.02682,0.00747172,17.6487,0.00500919,70.2574}

